{
  "title": "VPC Peering · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "두 VPC가 사설 IP로 직접 통신할 수 있도록 연결합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Peering</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#guide-1\">연결을 구성하는 순서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#guide-2\">연결 규모 판단하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>59 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Peering</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>VPC 피어링은 <strong>두 VPC 사이에 사설 IP 통신 경로를 만드는 연결</strong>입니다. 같은 계정뿐 아니라 다른 계정이나 다른 리전의 VPC를 연결할 때도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>두 네트워크를 합쳐 하나의 VPC로 만드는 방식은 아닙니다. 각 VPC의 주소, 라우팅, 보안 설정을 유지하면서 필요한 통신 경로를 서로 추가합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"requester-and-accepter\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"non-overlapping-cidr\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"non-transitive-routing\"></span><h2>연결을 구성하는 순서</h2><p>한쪽 VPC에서 피어링을 요청하고 다른 쪽에서 수락합니다. 두 VPC의 주소 범위는 서로 겹치지 않아야 합니다.</p><p>양쪽 라우팅 테이블에 상대 VPC 주소로 향하는 피어링 경로를 추가합니다. 보안 그룹과 NACL도 필요한 통신을 허용하고, 이름으로 접속한다면 DNS 해석 설정을 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"inter-region-peering\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dns-resolution\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"peering-or-transit-gateway\"></span><h2>연결 규모 판단하기</h2><p>피어링은 전이적 라우팅<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>을 지원하지 않습니다. A와 B, B와 C를 연결했어도 A에서 B를 경유해 C로 갈 수는 없습니다.</p><p>연결할 VPC가 많아지면 개별 피어링과 경로 관리가 복잡해집니다. 여러 네트워크를 중심 장치에 연결하려는 경우 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>피어링 설정 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>주소 확인</strong><span>두 VPC의 범위가 겹치지 않음</span></li><li><strong>연결 승인</strong><span>요청과 수락</span></li><li><strong>양쪽 경로 추가</strong><span>라우팅·보안 허용</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 피어링은 연결된 두 VPC 사이의 통신을 제공합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>운영 VPC의 애플리케이션이 별도 VPC의 내부 API를 호출해야 합니다. 두 VPC를 피어링하고 내부 API에 필요한 주소와 포트만 허용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>전이적 라우팅</strong> — 중간 네트워크를 거쳐 연결되지 않은 다른 네트워크까지 이동하는 방식입니다. VPC 피어링은 이런 중계 경로를 제공하지 않습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/peering/what-is-vpc-peering.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is VPC peering? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q008\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q019\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A's security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q094\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q005\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q006\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC Endpoint</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">다음 용어 <b>VPN / Direct Connect</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
